{"id":"necesidad","lemma":"necesidad","pos":"noun","rank":1165,"glosses":["need","necessity","neediness, state of being in need"],"ipa":"/neθesiˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"necesidades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-necesidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"No hay necesidad de preocuparse.","en":"There's no need to worry.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/522402","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to worry","l":"preocupar"}]},{"text":"No hay necesidad de llamar un taxi.","en":"There's no need to hail a taxi.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804553","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to summon, to call"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"taxi"}]},{"text":"Parece que no hay ninguna necesidad de ir.","en":"There seems to be no need to go.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/534314","words":[{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"nobody","l":"ninguno"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to go"}]},{"text":"Las necesidades de muchos pesan más que las de pocos.","en":"The needs of the many outweigh the needs of the few.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/767782","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"to weigh","l":"pesar"},null,null,{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"little, not much","l":"poco"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"apart from"]]},{"text":"Sentí la necesidad de hacerlo.","en":"I felt it was necessary to do it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/823266","words":[{"g":"to feel","l":"sentir"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"}]}]}